WEBVTT

00:00:00.663 --> 00:00:04.140
Two ways to spend time together
in South Florida.

00:00:05.180 --> 00:00:07.945
Mommy and Daddy Break Club
is a morning for parents,

00:00:07.980 --> 00:00:13.680
with coffee, a DJ, time to recharge
and easy introductions over brunch.

00:00:14.311 --> 00:00:17.225
We’re planning two mornings a month
in rotating venues

00:00:17.260 --> 00:00:20.640
with optional wellness experiences
on select dates.

00:00:21.370 --> 00:00:24.640
Retro Glam is a night built around
throwback music,

00:00:25.060 --> 00:00:27.300
dancing and styled photo moments.

00:00:28.607 --> 00:00:31.740
Both are experiences
we create and produce locally.

00:00:32.400 --> 00:00:35.125
Explore each format
and join the priority list

00:00:35.160 --> 00:00:37.620
for details when an edition opens.
